            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بدأ أبي الرسم في كهولته. badaʾa abī ar-rasm fī kuhūlatihi. My father took up painting in middle age."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A man in middle age is كهل."
